  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n30% of P = 15% of Q\n\n20% of Q = 10% of R\n\n**To find:**\n\n(R-P)/P × 100\n\n**Solution: **\n\n30% of P = 15% of Q\n\n20% of Q = 10% of R\n\n(30/100)P = (15/100)Q\n\n(20/100)Q = (10/100)R\n\nP = (1/2)Q\n\nQ = (1/2)R\n\nP = (1/4)R\n\nR = 4P\n\n**R is 300% more than P.**",
